LunaAgent Legacy (Beta) — macOS 10.14–12
=======================================

Version: __VERSION__

Reduced features
----------------
- Basic AppKit UI: enroll, Connect/Disconnect, status, WireGuard conf
- No full SwiftUI metrics / SMAppService
- Autostart via /Library LaunchAgents + LaunchDaemon pointing into the .app

Install
-------
Admin password once (postinstall registers helper). Prefer 13plus pkg on Ventura+.

Uninstall
---------
1. Quit LunaAgent and move /Applications/LunaAgent.app to Trash.
2. Residual plists (optional cleanup):

  sudo launchctl bootout system/com.lunaagent.wghelper 2>/dev/null
  sudo rm -f /Library/LaunchDaemons/com.lunaagent.wghelper.plist
  sudo rm -f /Library/LaunchAgents/com.lunaagent.daemon.plist
  sudo rm -f /Library/LaunchAgents/com.lunaagent.menubar.plist

Docs: https://github.com/mxxnly/Luna-Agent/blob/main/docs/install-legacy.md
